  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Landscapes C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus of IDH in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire is on developing a balance between forest, agriculture and people. By doing so, IDH supports the implementation of public and private sector commitments towards zero net deforestation and green growth on the ground. IDH aims to address policy opportunities at national level and to develop practical and scalable solutions at local and regional level.</narrative>
  </description>
